  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.header": "Uranium Fuel Rods",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_1": "Fuel rods emit particles",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_2": "The higher the temperature, the more particles",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_3": "When a particle hits another rod...",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_4": "Temp: 20",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_5": "Temp: 20",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_6": "This rod's temperature increases!",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_7": "Temp: 20",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_8": "Temp: 22.5",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_9": "Also rod's durability decrease",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_10": "A particle that enters the water along the way...",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_11": "Temp: 20",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_12": "Temp: 20",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_13": "Once it hits the rod, it heats it 4 times more!",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_14": "Temp: 20",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_15": "Temp: 25",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.uranium_fuel_rod.text_16": "However, rods underwater cool down 3 times faster",

  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.boron_control_rod.header": "Boron Control Rods",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.boron_control_rod.text_1": "Different blocks have different absorption levels",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.boron_control_rod.text_2": "The higher the absorption, the more likely a particle is to vanish when it hits the block",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.boron_control_rod.text_3": "The lower the absorption, the more likely a particle is to be reflected when it hits the block",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.boron_control_rod.text_4": "Boron control rod absorption: 90%%",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.boron_control_rod.text_5": "Obsidian: 40%%",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.boron_control_rod.text_6": "These blocks: 25%%",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.boron_control_rod.text_7": "And these: 15%%",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.boron_control_rod.text_8": "Iron block: 0%%",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.boron_control_rod.text_9": "That is why the reactor walls need to be made of iron for efficiency.",

  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.heat_pipe.header": "Heat Pipes",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.heat_pipe.text_1": "Heat pipes transfer heat to their neighbors",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.heat_pipe.text_2": "Temp: 20",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.heat_pipe.text_3": "Temp: 100",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.heat_pipe.text_4": "Temp: 20",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.heat_pipe.text_5": "Unlike fuel rods, they transfer heat not only vertically, but also horizontally",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.heat_pipe.text_6": "Temp: 100",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.heat_pipe.text_7": "Temp: 100",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.heat_pipe.text_8": "Temp: 100",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.heat_pipe.text_9": "Keep in mind that heat is not transferred instantly",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.heat_pipe.text_10": "Heat also gradually dissipates if it stops coming in",

  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.steam_turbine.header": "Steam Turbine",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.steam_turbine.text_1": "To turn heat into kinetic energy you need to:",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.steam_turbine.text_2": "1. Turn water into steam in a boiler connected to a heat source",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.steam_turbine.text_3": "2. Connect the steam turbine to the boiler",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.steam_turbine.text_4": "Don't forget to vent steam from the turbine, or it will stop working",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.steam_turbine.text_5": "Speed is always 16 RPM",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.steam_turbine.text_6": "The amount of SU generated depends on the steam supply rate",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.steam_turbine.text_7": "The rate of water-to-steam conversion depends on temperature",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.steam_turbine.text_8": "Keep in mind that the boiler cools the reactor while operating",

  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.nuclear_reactor.header": "Building a Nuclear Reactor",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.nuclear_reactor.text_1": "So, how do you build a nuclear reactor?",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.nuclear_reactor.text_2": "1. Build a floor of heat pipes",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.nuclear_reactor.text_3": "2. Build the walls",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.nuclear_reactor.text_4": "3. Insert the control rods and fuel rods",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.nuclear_reactor.text_5": "4. Add a mechanism to operate the control rods",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.nuclear_reactor.text_6": "Fasten the rods together with super glue so they can be lifted",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.nuclear_reactor.text_7": "Now the fuel rods will emit particles and raise the temperature",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.nuclear_reactor.text_8": "To keep the temperature from getting too high, you can lower the rods",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.nuclear_reactor.text_9": "This example reactor is very unstable: without cooling, even with the rods fully lowered, it will overheat and explode",
  "createnuclearindustrys.ponder.nuclear_reactor.text_10": "Better build your own reactor with more control rods"
}
